+## 8. Validation commands and results
+
+Validation ran on Windows with MSVC 19.50.35718.0, CMake/CTest 4.3.4, Python
+3.13.14, and the Visual Studio 18 2026 generator. Build trees were outside the
+checkout.
+
+The unmodified `v3.16.0` baseline was configured, built, and tested with:
+
+```powershell
+cmake -B C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\basic-test-build -S . -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug --preset basic-tests
+cmake --build C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\basic-test-build --config Debug --parallel
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\basic-test-build -C Debug --output-on-failure
+
+python tools/scripts/generateAmalgamatedFiles.py
+cmake -B C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\debug-build -S . -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug --preset all-tests
+cmake --build C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\debug-build --config Debug --parallel
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2\debug-build -C Debug --output-on-failure -j 4
+```
+
+Baseline results were 82/82 for `basic-tests` and 145/145 for `all-tests`,
+with no approval differences. The all build had four expected MSVC `D9025`
+warnings from the two disabled-exceptions test targets.
+
+During implementation, the same configure/build/full-CTest sequence was run
+after every slice. Focused commands used `ctest -C Debug --output-on-failure
+-R <filter>` with these filters:
+
+| Area | Filter and result |
+| --- | --- |
+| CLI | `RetryFailed|ApprovalTests`: 11/11 passed |
+| Zero-retry and state lifecycle | `RetryFailed::Scenarios|PartialTestCaseEvents`: 2/2 passed |
+| Fatal path | `RetryFailed::Fatal|Reporters::CrashInJunitReporter|RetryFailed::Scenarios|PartialTestCaseEvents`: 4/4 passed |
+| Cumulative reporters | `RetryFailed::Scenarios|RetryFailed::Fatal|Reporters::CrashInJunitReporter|BenchmarksInCumulativeReporter`: 4/4 passed |
+| Basic regression | `RunTests|ApprovalTests`: 2/2 passed |
+| Final amalgamation/retry check | `AmalgamatedFileTest|RetryFailed::Scenarios|RetryFailed::Fatal`: 3/3 passed |
+
+The final files were validated from new empty build directories with:
+
+```powershell
+python tools/scripts/generateAmalgamatedFiles.py
+
+cmake -B C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\basic-test-build -S . -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug --preset basic-tests
+cmake --build C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\basic-test-build --config Debug --parallel
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\basic-test-build -C Debug --output-on-failure -R 'RunTests|ApprovalTests'
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\basic-test-build -C Debug --output-on-failure
+
+cmake -B C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\debug-build -S . -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug --preset all-tests
+cmake --build C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\debug-build --config Debug --parallel
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\debug-build -C Debug --output-on-failure -R 'AmalgamatedFileTest|RetryFailed::Scenarios|RetryFailed::Fatal'
+ctest --test-dir C:\build\Course_AI\catch2-t13-final-fresh\debug-build -C Debug --output-on-failure -j 4
+```
+
+The generator concatenated 181 headers and 108 source files. The final fresh
+results were 92/92 for `basic-tests`, 157/157 for `all-tests`, 2/2 for the
+focused basic checks, and 3/3 for the focused amalgamation/retry checks.
+Approval tests produced no `*.unapproved.txt` files. The basic build had zero
+warnings; the all build had only the four baseline `D9025` warnings. The first
+fresh amalgamated build exposed duplicate anonymous-namespace helper names in
+JUnit and SonarQube; reporter-specific names fixed the single-translation-unit
+collision. A later clean build stopped when drive C: filled during linking;
+after removing only disposable task build output, the command was rerun from
+an empty directory and passed as reported above.
+
+Finally, `git diff --check`, `git status --short`, and a clean application of
+the patch series to `v3.16.0` were checked. Before this documentation-only
+file was added, the reproduced tree was identical to the validated branch.
